#: ecf47d51783945d3b3cbafa4bce91989
msgid "**Function macro**:"
msgstr "**函数宏**："

#: ../../modules/move.md:51 ../../modules/move.md:98 ../../modules/move.md:230
#: 799fb013dc2c41ecb0e4a9c1abecff37 836376d1e5df4423897b8b3124cbb7af
#: d6c0b7869242416d8b12666de030c1c3
#, python-brace-format
msgid "{nbt}`compound` Arguments"
msgstr "{nbt}`compound` 参数"

#: ../../modules/move.md:52 ../../modules/move.md:99 ../../modules/move.md:231
#: 2b885188e67d4a3ba8814874504b1202 3ef3af990c76436e83fff6b29d6d2849
#: 6e9025d91ba7404ca11717dcbe85e143
#, python-brace-format
msgid "{nbt}`number` **scale**: Scalar applied to the output."
msgstr "{nbt}`number` **scale**: 输出的缩放系数。"

#: ../../modules/move.md:53 ../../modules/move.md:100
#: d060930b2cf54bc6a2502e82cdc4e7bd fdb8387137ea4e408ffb268e529db374
#, python-brace-format
msgid "{nbt}`compound` **with**: Collision settings."
msgstr "{nbt}`compound` **with**: 碰撞设置。"

#: ../../modules/move.md:54 ../../modules/move.md:101
#: 601c5292aa1d43048753bc744c3149ff ca3e54419aa5472d80aa37e3427a17aa
#, python-brace-format
msgid "{nbt}`bool` {nbt}`string` **blocks**: Whether the entity should collide with blocks (default: true).   *Can be a [hitbox provider](hitbox.md#available-providers) (e.g. `function #bs.hitbox:callback/get_block_collision`).*"
msgstr "{nbt}`bool` {nbt}`string` **blocks**: 此实体是否和方块碰撞（默认：true）。可为方块碰撞箱类型（`interaction` 或 `collision`），`true` 默认等价于 `collision`。"

#: ../../modules/move.md:56 ../../modules/move.md:103
#: 2ad36188eccb4089965b3879a71b16a6 5b36faa1206e4260ae82ca5345154ee9
#, python-brace-format
msgid "{nbt}`bool` {nbt}`string` **entities**: Whether the entity should collide with entities (default: false).   *Can be a selector tag (typically assigned via `/tag`), which is preferred for performance.*"
msgstr "{nbt}`bool` {nbt}`string` **entities**: 其他实体能否阻挡移动（默认：false），建议用标签（Tags）来指定哪些实体可以阻挡移动，这样性能更好。"

#: ../../modules/move.md:58 ../../modules/move.md:105
#: 122740f9294745c6a7ca1b36bad460f9 64f66fe136c243d9a8a9ffd7223ce531
#, python-brace-format
msgid "{nbt}`string` **ignored_blocks**: Blocks to ignore (default: `#bs.hitbox:can_pass_through`)."
msgstr "{nbt}`string` **ignored_blocks**: 要忽略的方块（默认：`#bs.hitbox:can_pass_through`）。"

#: ../../modules/move.md:59 ../../modules/move.md:106
#: 05a6b0b5d16b455783192f223af89374 064d5b095a9f4cf98a7cd626d83a330a
#, python-brace-format
msgid "{nbt}`string` **ignored_entities**: Entity type to ignore (default: `#bs.hitbox:intangible`).   *Does not apply to entities with custom hitboxes.*"
msgstr "{nbt}`string` **ignored_entities**: 要忽略的实体类型（默认：`#bs.hitbox:intangible`）。不要在有自定义碰撞箱的实体上使用。"

#: ../../modules/move.md:61 d31f268fc27d426fb55b83bca906ba93
#, python-brace-format
msgid "{nbt}`string` **on_collision**: Command to run when a collision occurs.   *Used to resolve the collision (default: `function #bs.move:callback/bounce`).*"
msgstr "{nbt}`string` **on_collision**: 当碰撞时运行的命令，用来解决碰撞问题（默认: `function #bs.move:callback/bounce`）。"

#: ../../modules/move.md:65 ../../modules/move.md:111
#: 013d1a068c884a5ead96b86c2ac2cfe2 c473fb2f507d4374b4a41a9a338b887e
msgid "Lambdas"
msgstr "Lambda 表达式"

#: ../../modules/move.md:66 d7f009fec3af41d5982967e8feaf5af1
msgid "**Score `$move.hit_face bs.lambda`**: The face of the bounding box that was hit: 5 is east, 4 is west, 3 is south, 2 is north, 1 is top, and 0 is bottom."
msgstr "**分数 `$move.hit_face bs.lambda`**：被击中的边界盒的面：5 是东，4 是西，3 是南，2 是北，1 是顶，0 是底。"

#: ../../modules/move.md:68 ../../modules/move.md:114
#: 92bb689b892f4da28bdd12835f06584b ced590b410d24741b75ea8e8aa5aabbd
msgid "**Score `$move.hit_flag bs.lambda`**: The flag of the intersected bounding box, `-1` for entities."
msgstr "**分数 `$move.hit_flag bs.lambda`**：相交边界盒的标志，`-1` 表示实体。"

#: ../../modules/move.md:70 ../../modules/move.md:116
#: 1d76750a33a64b77b723eb4e784444ba 72b3b5a3f66f42b2af7a6e21c320d6da
msgid "**Scores `$move.vel.[x,y,z] bs.lambda`**: The remaining velocity in canonical coordinates after collision adjustments."
msgstr "**分数 `$move.vel.[x,y,z] bs.lambda`**：碰撞调整后规范坐标中的剩余速度。"

#: ../../modules/move.md:72 ../../modules/move.md:118 ../../modules/move.md:176
#: ../../modules/move.md:202 ../../modules/move.md:234
#: 1fb289e0d12440ce922fadb96bf9422c 42fd4dc2eb084cf2995c076b617c0332
#: 5bbe3ffc846a41d5846462088adab1a8 ba073ba47f7947d1af29fcd492d515b0
#: d6ac96af8abf413d8bf4a4e96c38168e
msgid "Outputs"
msgstr "输出"

#: ../../modules/move.md:73 72c66bf64aff4161958b5ab4e978f8c4
msgid "**State**: Entity is teleported according to its velocity scores."
msgstr "**状态**：实体根据其速度分数被传送。"

#: ../../modules/move.md 0c923d73e9324e34ac719ea2378f89be
msgid "Local"
msgstr "局部"

#: ../../modules/move.md:81 d47cd2bb919649208d746e5b1542f017
msgid "Experimental"
msgstr "实验性"

#: ../../modules/move.md:84 27d4d641ccca44a38b121abc9a521083
msgid "Always prefer the canonical version. Constant conversion between bases can lead to loss of accuracy, sometimes causing unpredictable behavior."
msgstr "始终优先使用标准版本。基数之间的持续转换可能导致精度损失，有时会造成不可预测的行为。"

#: ../../modules/move.md:86 31548021dd1640009e6ac01471d5e545
msgid "If you need to \"shoot\" an entity in a direction, you can still set velocity as a local vector and run `#bs.move:local_to_canonical` before using `#bs.move:apply_vel`."
msgstr "如果你需要向某个方向\"发射\"实体，你仍可以将速度设置为局部向量，并在使用 `#bs.move:apply_vel` 之前运行 `#bs.move:canonical_to_local`。"

#: ../../modules/move.md:89 d858d243b7cd4b268d5786b686be6e2a
msgid "Teleport an entity by its velocity scores, using the local reference frame, while handling collisions. Lambda scores are only available during callback execution (`on_*`)."
msgstr "使用局部参考系根据实体的速度分数进行传送，同时处理碰撞。"

#: ../../modules/move.md:94 6d7e4f8c666c451ba0080ffd10d5bf59
msgid "**Scores `@s bs.vel.[x,y,z]`**: Local velocity vector."
msgstr "**分数 `@s bs.vel.[x,y,z]`**：局部速度向量。"

#: ../../modules/move.md:108 58b21064b6ef45cca59dbd591bd300ca
#, python-brace-format
msgid "{nbt}`string` **on_collision**: Command to run when a collision occurs, used to resolve the collision (default: `function #bs.move:callback/bounce`)."
msgstr "{nbt}`string` **on_collision**: 当碰撞时运行的命令，用来解决碰撞问题（默认: `function #bs.move:callback/bounce`）。"

#: ../../modules/move.md:112 59e30bf165d04affb0c32e6176866e65
msgid "**Score `$move.hit_face bs.lambda`**: The face of the bounding box that was hit."
msgstr "**分数 `$move.hit_face bs.lambda`**：被击中的边界盒的面。"

#: ../../modules/move.md:119 58407c0812154c8db8a9dd2930cd0fe9
msgid "**State**: Entity is teleported according to its local velocity scores."
msgstr "**状态**：实体根据其局部速度分数被传送。"

#: ../../modules/move.md c3cec1fbe7904dd0abc2624755d03a4d
msgid "What is a Bounding Box?"
msgstr "什么是边界盒？"

#: ../../modules/move.md:128 4b40148e90d645ddb21121e668c42c4c
msgid "A bounding box is a simple rectangular box that surrounds an object—or part of it—to help the game figure out where it is and what it touches. For example, a set of stairs in Minecraft uses two bounding boxes: one for the lower step and one for the upper step."
msgstr "边界框是一个简单的矩形框，环绕物体（或物体的一部分），帮助游戏确定其位置和接触对象。例如，Minecraft 中的一组楼梯使用两个边界框：一个用于下台阶，一个用于上台阶。"

#: ../../modules/move.md:131 458bb2f7160440839be922e26d3fea54
msgid "Custom Hitboxes"
msgstr "自定义碰撞箱"

#: ../../modules/move.md:133 027140bc445e4b2b8a09962893138169
msgid "Bookshelf supports multiple [hitbox types](hitbox.md#hitbox-types) for precise control. Blocks can use custom [hitbox providers](hitbox.md#available-providers). Entities support three types: `dynamic`, `baked`, and `custom`."
msgstr "Bookshelf 支持多种碰撞箱类型以实现精确控制。方块可使用 `interaction` 或 `collision` 碰撞箱，实体支持三种类型：`dynamic`、`baked` 和 `custom`。"

#: ../../modules/move.md:136 83122c4413234d679743dcfcc3f2f0ce
msgid "*Example: Move a cube (block_display) by its velocity scores (uses an interaction as the hitbox):*"
msgstr "*示例：根据速度分数移动立方体（block_display）（使用交互实体作为碰撞箱）：*"

#: ../../modules/move.md:155 6c2fb30f62cd4e38998498a14835d2d2
msgid "Performance Tip"
msgstr "性能提示"

#: ../../modules/move.md:158 1278d6783c1f41c8a4d9d79bbd963c66
msgid "Although this system doesn't set specific limits, it's important to note that performance is influenced by both the speed and size of the entity."
msgstr "虽然此系统没有设置具体限制，但需要注意性能受实体的速度和大小的影响。"

#: ../../modules/move.md:161 ../../modules/move.md:187
#: ../../modules/move.md:213 ../../modules/move.md:251
