#: ../../modules/move.md:165 48e332c6e8c1491e96fd7b05259a4dfd
msgid "Canonical to Local"
msgstr "标准转局部"

#: ../../modules/move.md:169 dd68f063a21b40c7b63022c2ccdcd1c2
msgid "Convert a canonical velocity (using the relative reference frame) into a local velocity (using the local reference frame)."
msgstr "将标准速度（使用相对参考系）转换为局部速度（使用局部参考系）。"

#: ../../modules/move.md:172 ../../modules/move.md:198
#: 10512fabbee44686b9b8898bd8be7b21 8844fb6006004635aa3a8c38adec5f2d
msgid "**Execution `rotated as <entity>` or `rotated <h> <v>`**: Rotation used for the conversion."
msgstr "**执行 `rotated as <entity>` 或 `rotated <h> <v>`**：用于转换的旋转。"

#: ../../modules/move.md:174 ../../modules/move.md:200
#: c00864b7abcd460d96a5d3fc6d3a49a8 d0dfabf719264e728bb29a192f1f27c1
msgid "**Scores `@s bs.vel.[x,y,z]`**: Velocity to convert."
msgstr "**分数 `@s bs.vel.[x,y,z]`**：要转换的速度。"

#: ../../modules/move.md:177 ../../modules/move.md:203
#: 1d9ff231c21745478ce4fc5599b27dfc e7785c46cafa4b4ab73223b85a2827c3
msgid "**Scores `@s bs.vel.[x,y,z]`**: Converted velocity."
msgstr "**分数 `@s bs.vel.[x,y,z]`**：转换后的速度。"

#: ../../modules/move.md 3af5aec39e6f47c691c99ebcca79a1f5
#: d73366bd6a3c41be8fb4e9c5a3463a5a
msgid "What is a Local Velocity?"
msgstr "有速度？"

#: ../../modules/move.md:184 ../../modules/move.md:210
#: 0962ece6d81f48dcb7cdbb344ce98cc3 e6d3fa7cac1a43baae1172367fcc60da
msgid "Unlike relative velocity (canonical), this reference frame considers the entity's rotation. Therefore, when the parent entity rotates, the child entity rotates around it. For those familiar with Minecraft commands, local coordinates are available through the `^` symbol."
msgstr "与相对速度（标准）不同，此参考系考虑实体的旋转。因此，当父实体旋转时，子实体围绕它旋转。对熟悉 Minecraft 命令的人来说，局部坐标可通过 `^` 符号使用。"

#: ../../modules/move.md:191 25957e8fc929453aaeb5c06ae0079112
msgid "Local to Canonical"
msgstr "局部转标准"

#: ../../modules/move.md:195 73e7eec76aad4e2aa8632ab38d3000c3
msgid "Convert a local velocity (using the local reference frame) into a canonical velocity (using the relative reference frame)."
msgstr "将局部速度（使用局部参考系）转换为标准速度（使用相对参考系）。"

#: ../../modules/move.md:217 7c2799c5615b488e827592d000515c85
msgid "Set Motion"
msgstr "设置运动"

#: ../../modules/move.md:221 2a8241056e1648d4a4610c056e3be925
