msgstr "使用速度分数设置实体的运动（Motion）NBT。"

#: ../../modules/move.md:226 4479d3ab1a154008ad07cdbe731df07b
msgid "**Scores `@s bs.vel.[x,y,z]`**: Velocity vector."
msgstr "**分数 `@s bs.vel.[x,y,z]`**：速度向量。"

#: ../../modules/move.md:235 03d6385b43ed4b1d8d7e758ed0fa75ca
msgid "**State**: Motion is applied to the given entity."
msgstr "**状态**：运动被应用到给定实体。"

