msgstr "你可以在下方找到此模块中的所有可用谓词。"

#: ../../modules/move.md:261 147e12fdf70f4cfe95d92fa255e2a058
msgid "Has Velocity?"
msgstr "有速度？"

#: ../../modules/move.md:263 b5fb3123fea14762bdbfad620c6df85d
msgid "**`bs.move:has_vel`**"
msgstr "**`bs.move:has_vel`**"

#: ../../modules/move.md:265 5e2a25c99c1743b090f1f1447818efc2
msgid "Determine if an entity has a nonzero velocity score."
msgstr "确定实体是否有非零速度分数。"

#: ../../modules/move.md:271 65b8cb5ab8e34c6ca4ba824424e667ab
msgid "🎓 Custom Collisions"
msgstr "🎓 自定义碰撞"

#: ../../modules/move.md:273 2bd2bfd0b660491c8e98f5228b9a6c5c
msgid "This module allows you to customize collision behaviors according to your specific needs."
msgstr "此模块允许你根据特定需求自定义碰撞行为。"

#: ../../modules/move.md:277 cab5b3a5788f4fb9be27c7f88619cc78
msgid "By modifying the `on_collision` input argument, you have the freedom to specify the function that triggers upon collision. However, managing the resolution yourself can be quite challenging. This is why Bookshelf provides several predefined functions:"
msgstr "通过修改 `on_collision` 输入键，你可以自由指定碰撞时触发的函数。然而，自行管理解决方案可能相当具有挑战性。这就是为什么 Bookshelf 提供了几个预定义函数："

#: ../../modules/move.md:280 a7f8a1cc92434f2a8e1b9aca7f6a70a7
msgid "`#bs.move:callback/bounce`"
msgstr "`#bs.move:callback/bounce`"

#: ../../modules/move.md:281 2834389d824046f8b3e9f920520d1bdb
msgid "The entity will bounce on the collision surface."
msgstr "实体将在碰撞表面反弹。"

#: ../../modules/move.md:282 21722b66c2cd417f8b1936944d264755
msgid "`#bs.move:callback/damped_bounce`"
msgstr "`#bs.move:callback/damped_bounce`"

#: ../../modules/move.md:283 9ca67f93cc1c4072be1bddc91da7e8d6
msgid "The entity speed is reduced by 2 on each bounce."
msgstr "实体速度在每次反弹时减少2。"

#: ../../modules/move.md:284 cdc73e6737d84254bf57f3833e8656d4
msgid "`#bs.move:callback/slide`"
msgstr "`#bs.move:callback/slide`"

#: ../../modules/move.md:285 56b682316341429f9459b25557e1e983
msgid "The entity will stick and slide along the collision surface."
msgstr "实体将粘附并沿碰撞表面滑动。"

#: ../../modules/move.md:286 1fd893be4e9a42c282da28837f99c9a7
msgid "`#bs.move:callback/stick`"
msgstr "`#bs.move:callback/stick`"

#: ../../modules/move.md:287 6d18e90c26da475e84d1b14577eb6f17
msgid "The entity will stop and stick to the collision surface."
msgstr "实体将停止并粘附在碰撞表面上。"

#: ../../modules/move.md:290 9e884a24d5694919b0d4904557f02ecc
msgid "How It Works"
msgstr "工作原理？"

#: ../../modules/move.md:292 70fece3b2237489796305b0cbc11f28d
msgid "When a collision occurs, the system tracks which bounding box was hit using the velocity and the flag of that bounding box. You can modify:"
msgstr "当发生碰撞时，系统使用速度和该边界框的标志来追踪被击中的边界框。你可以修改："

#: ../../modules/move.md:294 f1a3b7cde01d4b40abfec7519bb42249
msgid "`@s bs.vel.[x,y,z]`: the velocity that will be applied on the next tick."
msgstr "`@s bs.vel.[x,y,z]`：将在下一个游戏刻应用的速度。"

#: ../../modules/move.md:295 f520252302dd472580a430886d8d0eec
msgid "`$move.vel.[x,y,z] bs.lambda`: the remaining velocity after rolling back to the time of impact."
msgstr "`$move.vel.[x,y,z] bs.lambda`：回退到碰撞时刻后剩余的速度。"

#: ../../modules/move.md:297 2f66c5598d1940c6b2d42bbece4b30f9
msgid "To simplify the creation of custom behaviors, there's no need to handle a local velocity directly. The vector is automatically converted before and after the collision resolution."
msgstr "为了简化这些行为的创建，无需直接处理局部速度。向量在碰撞处理前后会自动转换。如果你需要有关自定义碰撞的帮助，可以在我们的 [Discord 服务器](https://discord.gg/MkXytNjmBt)上询问！"

#: ../../modules/move.md:299 7d11f0cd732c4964972f32a1e4200d6a
msgid "Velocity Scaling"
msgstr "速度缩放"

#: ../../modules/move.md:301 26606245805f49a4b5d406be69c56012
msgid "Remaining velocity scores are stored as scaled integers, but the scaling factor may change without breaking compatibility."
msgstr "剩余速度值以缩放整数的形式存储，但缩放系数可随时变更，并且这不破坏兼容性。"

#: ../../modules/move.md:303 aa211809c94944c2a66a0207e3a81319
msgid "To ensure stability, always manipulate these values independently of the scaling factor."
msgstr "为了确保稳定性，请保持计算操作和缩放系数无关。"

#: ../../modules/move.md:306 fe2c4c51a5eb48ff99d28b2b5dc7b37b
msgid "The simplest collision resolution is to stop the movement."
msgstr "最简单的碰撞处理是停止移动。"

#: ../../modules/move.md:308 4c225cc056c04c958cdef962971075d8
msgid "*`#bs.move:callback/stick`*"
msgstr "*`#bs.move:callback/stick`*"

#: ../../modules/move.md:316 525bd7efd6354838a5de6c00fabf8fd7
msgid "For sliding, we need to cancel the velocity on the axis that was hit and continue traveling the remaining distance."
msgstr "对于滑动，我们需要取消被阻挡的轴上的速度，并继续行进剩余距离。"

#: ../../modules/move.md:318 aa87d081b98a413da996984f69a5c8c3
msgid "*`#bs.move:callback/slide`*"
msgstr "*`#bs.move:callback/slide`*"

#: ../../modules/move.md:326 cb8a7aa749ae4042929f5ab96701af79
msgid "Flags and Tags"
msgstr "标记和标签"

#: ../../modules/move.md:328 4d18a2e19e984c25af2481459083407c
msgid "Flags and tags let you control how entities interact with multiple overlapping bounding boxes, for example, allowing movement through fluid shapes while stopping at solid shapes."
msgstr "标记和标签让你控制实体如何与多个重叠的边界框交互，例如，允许穿过流体形状，同时停在固体形状处。"

#: ../../modules/move.md:330 acf25677a01e4568a1d6264d10a8ddbd
msgid "Each bounding box has a numeric `flag` (`1`, `2`, `4`, or `8`)."
msgstr "每个边界框都有一个数值 `flag`（`1`、`2`、`4` 或 `8`）。"

#: ../../modules/move.md:331 c7beb6ea3da54cc09cbb686e3f304de9
msgid "When an entity enters a bounding box, it receives a tag `bs.move.flag.<flag>`, which prevents repeated collisions while inside bounding boxes with the same flag. The tag is removed once the entity is no longer inside any bounding box with the same flag."
msgstr "当实体进入一个边界框时，它会收到标签 `bs.move.flag.<flag>`，这可以防止在具有相同标志的边界框内重复碰撞。一旦实体不再位于任何具有相同标志的边界框内，该标签就会被移除。"

#: ../../modules/move.md:333 07863b7ec87e46b0b0c1b49f52a8628e
msgid "Flags are particularly useful when using a [hitbox provider](hitbox.md#available-providers) that handles fluids. For example, here's how a waterlogged stairs could respond:"
msgstr "在使用处理流体的 [碰撞箱提供器](hitbox.md#available-providers) 时，标记特别有用。例如，下面是积水楼梯的响应方式："

#: ../../modules/move.md:335 ccffcca8cfed42e888fefae6a35d3e7e
msgid "The stairs have two types of bounding boxes:"
msgstr "楼梯有两种类型的边界框："

#: ../../modules/move.md:336 8404248d616e4f01b35284dcd4b55eaf
msgid "**Fluid** (water) with flag `2`"
msgstr "**流体**（水）带标志 `2`"

#: ../../modules/move.md:337 c048415d77b242999b1f825de4aa1e45
msgid "**Solid** (stairs themselves) with flag `1`"
msgstr "**固体**（楼梯本身）带标志 `1`"

#: ../../modules/move.md:339 4e62246ec9fd4901be4e8fca3efa4fa4
msgid "The entity enters the water:"
msgstr "实体进入水中："

#: ../../modules/move.md:340 95f0fe443fd94681a6cc4e7aaf8e1764
msgid "`on_collision` is triggered."
msgstr "触发 `on_collision`。"

#: ../../modules/move.md:341 11c19b73661744829e208d1b74681cdc
msgid "We can choose to preserve the velocity along the axis of collision."
msgstr "我们可以选择保留沿碰撞轴的速度。"

#: ../../modules/move.md:342 2a82e4dd1146452b95371b64127b1b54
msgid "The entity receives `bs.move.flag.2`."
msgstr "实体收到 `bs.move.flag.2`。"

#: ../../modules/move.md:343 8eef46eefd2848328db519d19e8b5ba3
msgid "While this tag is active, collisions with other water blocks or fluid shapes do nothing, so the entity keeps moving smoothly through fluids."
msgstr "当此标签激活时，与其他水方块或流体形状的碰撞不会发生任何作用，因此实体在流体中平滑移动。"

#: ../../modules/move.md:345 98954930394a49a59742e1535f20d7bc
msgid "The entity hits the solid part of the stairs:"
msgstr "实体击中楼梯的固体部分："

#: ../../modules/move.md:346 d10e6e8f656e4f6e84541bfa069a3fce
msgid "`on_collision` is triggered again."
msgstr "再次触发 `on_collision`。"

#: ../../modules/move.md:347 be2fb8b815e44f36b224da49c6fd8095
msgid "This time we reverse the velocity (bounce)."
msgstr "这次我们反转速度（弹跳）。"

#: ../../modules/move.md:348 5f393749ba7a46959b7bfad6ecaf6be8
msgid "No tag is set, so collisions with other solid shapes are processed normally."
msgstr "没有设置标签，因此与其他固体形状的碰撞正常处理。"

#: ../../modules/move.md:349 c8c825b681ea4772b2ced8db9a0159a9
msgid "The entity stops or bounces off as expected, like a normal solid collision."
msgstr "实体按预期停止或弹开，如同正常的固体碰撞。"

#: ../../modules/move.md:351 407ee34c21554ecf84549eb8761ae95f
msgid "If you need help with custom collisions, you can ask us on our [discord server](https://discord.gg/MkXytNjmBt)!"
msgstr "如果你需要自定义碰撞方面的帮助，可以在我们的 [Discord 服务器](https://discord.gg/MkXytNjmBt) 上提问！"

#: ../../_templates/comments.md:4 938ee02182444656b6f1b4da3fa99df3
msgid "**💬 Did it help you?**"
msgstr "**💬 这对你有帮助吗？**"

#: ../../_templates/comments.md:6 7268f2b3739848489f7986e4af6b9b0b
msgid "Feel free to leave your questions and feedback below!"
msgstr "欢迎在下方留下你的问题和反馈！"

#~ msgid "{nbt}`bool` **blocks**: Whether the entity should collide with blocks (default: true)."
#~ msgstr "{nbt}`bool` **blocks**: 方块能否阻挡移动（默认: true）。"

#~ msgid "{nbt}`string` **hitbox_shape**: Hitbox type: `interaction` or `collision` (default: `collision`)."
#~ msgstr "{nbt}`string` **hitbox_shape**: 碰撞箱类型: `interaction` 或 `collision`（默认: `collision`）。"

#~ msgid "Collision / Interaction Shape"
#~ msgstr "碰撞/交互形状"

#~ msgid "**Collision Shape**: Defines the physical boundaries of a block that entities cannot pass through. It determines where an entity will stop when moving towards the block."
#~ msgstr "**碰撞形状（collision_shape）**：实体无法穿过的方块的物理边界，决定实体在靠近方块时会被阻挡在什么位置。"

#~ msgid "**Interaction Shape**: Defines the area where the player can interact with or break the block. This includes actions such as right-clicking to open a GUI (e.g., chests, furnaces) or mining the block. Some blocks have an interaction shape but no collision, such as crops or scaffolding."
#~ msgstr "**交互形状（interaction_shape）**：玩家可以与方块交互或破坏的区域。这包括右键打开 GUI（如箱子、熔炉）或采掘方块等操作。有些方块有交互形状但没有碰撞，比如农作物或脚手架。"

#~ msgid "Hitbox Types"
#~ msgstr "碰撞箱类型"

#~ msgid "See [Hitbox Types](hitbox.md#types) for full details."
#~ msgstr "完整说明请参见[碰撞箱类型](hitbox.md#types)。"

#~ msgid "Local Velocity... 🥶 What's this?"
#~ msgstr "局部速度... 🥶 这是什么？"

#~ msgid "Upon collision, you have the freedom to update both the velocity score that will be used in the next tick `@s bs.vel.[x,y,z]` and the remaining velocity `$move.vel.[x,y,z] bs.lambda`. Since the module will attempt to continue moving based on the remaining velocity, it's crucial to avoid introducing a race condition."
#~ msgstr "发生碰撞时，你可以自由更新下一刻将使用的速度分数 `@s bs.vel.[x,y,z]` 和剩余速度 `$move.vel.[x,y,z] bs.lambda`。因为模块将尝试以剩余速度继续移动，所以这个过程中必须避免引发竞态条件。"
